  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-XXoKI7ED\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BDWotIel\">SPI目前支持的订阅服务类型及对应类型返回的参数结构</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-vL3YVvMn\">目前支持订阅服务类型：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-n9ObthI8\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">report.qianchuan.ad.activeprogram</code> 千川营销计划报表实时数据</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-cVHF4qT7\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">report.qianchuan.advertiser.activeprogram</code> 千川客户报表实时数据</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-vap9Lf7R\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong></strong></span><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">report.aweme.order.activeprogram</code> 随心推订单报表实时数据</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-4qg1JQ95\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">status.aweme.order.realtime</code> 随心推订单状态实时推送</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-zZHpdCK3\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">status.material.qianchuan.realtime</code> 巨量千川素材状态推送</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-VgUsnroS\"><strong>可根据文档提供对应服务类型结构构造请求数据，调用自身设置的回调地址，来模拟接收推送事件</strong>